#: ../../source/users/basics/launch_mac.rst:6
msgid "Launch QElectroTech on Mac"
msgstr "在 Mac 上启动 QElectroTech"

#: ../../source/users/basics/launch_mac.rst:8
msgid ""
"After installation, QElectroTech can be launched from applications folder."
msgstr "安装完成后，可以从应用程序文件夹启动 QElectroTech。"

#: ../../source/users/basics/launch_mac.rst:14
msgid "Figure: Starting splash screen"
msgstr "图：启动画面"

#: ../../source/users/basics/launch_mac.rst:18
msgid ""
"For easier access, QElectroTech can be added to the dock. Just open the "
"applications folder and drag QElectroTech to the dock."
msgstr "为方便访问，可以将 QElectroTech 添加到程序坞。只需打开应用程序文件夹，然后将 QElectroTech 拖到程序坞即可。"

#: ../../source/users/basics/launch_mac.rst:20
msgid "Once QElectroTech has been launched, the main window looks as follow:"
msgstr "QElectroTech 启动后，主窗口如下所示："

#: ../../source/users/basics/launch_mac.rst:26
msgid "Figure: Main window QElectroTech"
msgstr "图：QElectroTech 主窗口"
